{"id":"vod_bf_1951","vodId":"1951","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"巴克·亚罗","name_cn":"巴克·亚罗","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-3/ee380a1ae86052bee5369f91cbc856b6.jpg"},"summary":"林伽林德——这片土地是被墙壁包围起来的世界。墙壁将这片土地覆盖、守护、哺育、培养。墙壁即是神——是这片大地，林伽林德的根基。某天，在林伽林德边境之地「艾泽村」出现了一位神秘男子「巴克·亚罗」。亚罗失去了记忆，却唯独知道自己是「从“墙壁外”来的」。亚罗为了取回记忆而以墙壁之外为目标，却逐渐被卷入围绕着自身的争斗当中——","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 16:31:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第15集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bakeyaluo/第16集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":